{"about_the_game":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Travel to a mystical land and explore its secrets.</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4092140/extras/9687fc206b4631274d1dd607861155c3.avif?t=1765967923\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4092140/extras_big/9687fc206b4631274d1dd607861155c3.webp?t=1765967923 width=1560 height=739 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >About the Game:</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >If you like classic RPGs like the Gothic series, you've come to the right place. Buy the game once and enjoy it with no commercial breaks or hidden in-app purchases. Explore an open world in a lovingly designed low-poly look.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Tired of having to log in every day in order not to miss something? No problem, save and load whenever and wherever you are. You don't miss a thing here!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4092140/extras/0ce405a27417a5d2771800d80a9b9489.avif?t=1765967923\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4092140/extras_big/0ce405a27417a5d2771800d80a9b9489.webp?t=1765967923 width=1560 height=739 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Core functions are:</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u2022 Story driven gameplay with focus on conversations (like Gothic series)</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u2022 Classic fantasy role-playing experience</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u2022 Evolve your Hero</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u2022 Many quests</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u2022 Open World - Explore on your own</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u2022 Innovative combat system</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u2022 Different professions (Alchemy, skinning, forging etc.)</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u2022 Explore hidden secrets</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u2022 Choose your Weapon: Bow, Sword, Axe, Mace etc.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u2022 Cast mighty spells \u2013 Fire Arrow up to Fire Rain</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u2022 Controller Support</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Developed by just one person.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Languages available: English, German, Czech (M), French (M), Italian (M), Polish (M), Japanese (M), Korean (M), Portuguese (M), Russian (M), Spanish (M), Ukrainian (M) (M = Machine translated)</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Help a solo developer tweak the game. You don't like something? No problem, write an email and I'll see what I can do.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/4092140?t=1765967923","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/4092140?t=1765967923","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4092140/fda56bc20d943f768f0c3bca2d5352a26d6896bd/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1765967923","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4092140/fda56bc20d943f768f0c3bca2d5352a26d6896bd/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1765967923","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Full controller support","id":28},{"description":"Custom Volume Controls","id":68},{"description":"Keyboard Only Option","id":75},{"description":"Mouse Only Option","id":76},{"description":"Save Anytime","id":79},{"description":"Touch Only Option","id":77},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"controller_support":"full","detailed_description":"<h2 class=\"b