p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u2022 Different professions (Alchemy, skinning, forging etc.)</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u2022 Explore hidden secrets</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u2022 Choose your Weapon: Bow, Sword, Axe, Mace etc.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u2022 Cast mighty spells \u2013 Fire Arrow up to Fire Rain</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u2022 Controller Support</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Developed by just one person.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Languages available: English, German, Czech (M), French (M), Italian (M), Polish (M), Japanese (M), Korean (M), Portuguese (M), Russian (M), Spanish (M), Ukrainian (M) (M = Machine translated)</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Help a solo developer tweak the game. You don't like something? No problem, write an email and I'll see what I can do.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>","developers":["Just Stezi"],"genres":[{"description":"Adventure","id":"25"},{"description":"Indie","id":"23"},{"description":"RPG","id":"3"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4092140/67ba573be598b278d4077b27f9c2ba8fc05d6982/header.jpg?t=1765967923","is_free":false,"linux_requirements":[],"mac_requirements":[],"movies":[{"dash_av1":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/4092140/1911760316/61f1ec0bb4e7d258fc74701aea43a1adcd0e7f76/1760693443/dash_av1.mpd?t=1760694064","dash_h264":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/4092140/1911760316/61f1ec0bb4e7d258fc74701aea43a1adcd0e7f76/1760693443/dash_h264.mpd?t=1760694064","highlight":true,"hls_h264":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/4092140/1911760316/61f1ec0bb4e7d258fc74701aea43a1adcd0e7f76/1760693443/hls_264_master.m3u8?t=1760694064","id":257213175,"name":"Paign - Trailer","thumbnail":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/257213175/47cf9400703ee24228633ab223c4f6d7f09d768d/mo